<configs>

	<!--
		Vanilla wildChicken is RestrictedMove="true,CollectorCatalysts,ToolBelt", i.e. a live chicken
		may only sit in your toolbelt or in a coop's catalyst slot. Adding "Vehicle" lets a scooped
		bird ride in the truck's storage, which is what makes truck -> coop hauling possible.

		Backpack MUST be here too even though nothing about this is a backpack: vehicle storage is a
		Bag, and Bag.AddItem (plus XUiC_BagContainer.AddItem, which is the vehicle grid) hard-codes
		CanMoveTo(StackLocationTypes.Backpack) as its gate before it will accept anything. Without
		Backpack every insert into vehicle storage is refused, which reads to the player as
		"vehicle storage is full" on every single scoop. Vehicle alone is only enough for the
		drag-onto-a-slot path.
	-->
	<set xpath="/items/item[@name='wildChicken']/property[@name='RestrictedMove']/@value">true,CollectorCatalysts,ToolBelt,Vehicle,Backpack</set>

</configs>
